WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
For centuries, Thai boys learned
to read at the village temple,

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.530
taught by monks.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.380
Then, over the 20th century,
the state took over schools,

4
00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.500
hospitals and welfare.

5
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.980
Cities grew.

6
00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.890
Many people now meet monks mainly
at ceremonies and funerals.

7
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:21.110
So what is the Sangha for
now, and who gets to decide?

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.100
In this mission, you'll look at the
new work Thai monks have taken on.

9
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:30.130
Then you'll weigh up whether monastic
life and the precepts still matter today.

10
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:33.500
Your mission: find out
what the Sangha is for now,

11
00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:34.850
and who decides.
